  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa Blue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to develop innovative benefits sharing and financing solutions for blue carbon projects. Blue&#x2019;s objective is to use its current projects in Sierra Leone and Guinea as proofs of-concept for high quality, financially sustainable projects to help build the market and catalyze investment into the sector. The funding would be complementary and de-risk a potential future investment by FSDAi, facilitating deeper insight into Blue&#x2019;s projects, increased exposure to the management team, and help with establishing its BSAs, a critical step to attracting further investment.</narrative>
  </description>
